{"id":"wb-7-1570","name":"丹霞山摩崖石刻","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"丹霞山摩崖石刻","text":"丹霞山摩崖石刻位于中华人民共和国广东省韶关市仁化县丹霞山长老峰，1989年被列为仁化县文物保护单位，2008年被列为广东省文物保护单位，2013年被列为第七批全国重点文物保护单位。\n丹霞山摩崖石刻的年代上起北宋，下迄民国，其中宋刻8处，元刻9处，主要集中分布在锦石岩寺和别传寺老山门前，以及梦觉关、通天峡、洪岩、半寨、海螺峰、宝珠峰等区域。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%B8%B9%E9%9C%9E%E5%B1%B1%E6%91%A9%E5%B4%96%E7%9F%B3%E5%88%BB","revisionId":94224408,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94224408","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/dc2dca001c54ae448c872fcd.jpg","title":"Renhua_Danxia_Shan_Moya_Shike_2013.12.08_11-47-21.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Renhua_Danxia_Shan_Moya_Shike_2013.12.08_11-47-21.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/26/Renhua_Danxia_Shan_Moya_Shike_2013.12.08_11-47-21.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Zhangzhugang","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"广东省仁化县丹霞山摩崖石刻——\n\n别传寺摩崖石刻群","width":320,"height":213}}